  "what_happened_next": {
    "text": "Amazon more than tripled over five years, leading this set, but its path included very large monthly falls. Apple gained less, while Microsoft lagged both cash and bonds. The US basket and cash ended quite close. The final ranking hides how differently these investments felt along the way.",
    "source_ids": [
